User Stories
1. Doctor
As a Doctor, I want to log in securely so that I can access my account.
As a Doctor, I want to view my appointments so that I can manage my schedule.
As a Doctor, I want to view patient medical records so that I can provide appropriate treatment.
As a Doctor, I want to update patient diagnoses and prescriptions.
As a Doctor, I want to manage my availability for appointments.
2. Patient
As a Patient, I want to register and log in so that I can access my personal account.
As a Patient, I want to view available doctors so that I can choose a suitable doctor.
As a Patient, I want to book appointments online.
As a Patient, I want to view and manage my appointments.
As a Patient, I want to access my medical history and prescriptions.
As a Patient, I want to update my personal information.
3. Admin
As an Admin, I want to log in securely so that I can manage the system.
As an Admin, I want to add, update, and delete doctor accounts.
As an Admin, I want to manage patient accounts.
As an Admin, I want to manage appointments.
As an Admin, I want to view system activity and generate reports.
As an Admin, I want to manage user roles and permissions.
